{"id": "3326525", "name": "אינטגרלים כפולים – שינוי סדר עם פיצול התחום", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_DOUBLE_LAYOUT_V4\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">שינוי סדר אינטגרציה – איחוד שני אינטגרלים</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div>נתון הסכום</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 19px; margin: 10px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\int_0^{{{CT:0}}}\\int_{-\\sqrt{y}}^{\\sqrt{y}} f\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dx\\,dy +\\int_{{{CT:0}}}^{{{CT:1}}}\\int_{-\\sqrt{y}}^{{{CT:2}}-y} f\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dx\\,dy\\)</div>\n<div>ניתן לכתוב את הסכום כאינטגרל יחיד בסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dy\\,dx\\)</span>:</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 19px; margin: 10px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\int_a^b\\int_{c(x)}^{d(x)} f\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dy\\,dx\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">הזינו את ארבעת הגבולות</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(175px,1fr)); gap: 10px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; align-items: start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; min-width: 170px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-it