border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>שני האינטגרלים מתארים יחד את התחום שבין הפרבולה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y=x^2\\)</span> לבין הישר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y={{CT:2}}-x\\)</span>.</p>\n<p>נקודות החיתוך מתקבלות מ־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x^2={{CT:2}}-x\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:3}},{{CT:4}}\\)</span>.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\int_{{{CT:3}}}^{{{CT:4}}}\\int_{x^2}^{{{CT:2}}-x}f\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dy\\,dx\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]] [[feedback:prt3]] [[feedback:prt4]]<span style=\"position: absolute; left: -10000px; top: auto; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">[[feedback:prt5]] [[feedback:prt6]] [[feedback:prt7]] [[feedback:prt8]]</span></div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "i